// Soyuz (11A511) (1967).
// The R-7: the Blok A core and four strap-ons (Blok B, V, G and D) lit together, the
// strap-ons dropping at two minutes; then the Blok I third stage, lit through the
// open truss it stands on before the core lets go, and a Soyuz 7K-OK under its
// fairing and escape tower. Built from plain parts: each strap-on is the
// `r7_strap_on` assembly (mods/realism/assemblies/boosters.json5) placed on the core.
